- confidence: low when the photos are dark, partial or the dish is ambiguous. assumptions: one line stating anything you guessed that changes the numbers a lot (e.g. 'assumed fresh egg pasta, not dried').
- pending_match: if this meal is clearly a pending item (e.g. a voice note earlier said 'pasta' with no amount), give that item_raw; otherwise null.

OTHER (photo_type other): everything else null, readable false.`;
